msgstr "Start with a pure factory"

#. Markdown. Preserve links, inline code and table/list syntax.
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: docs/guide/model-composition.md
msgid "The factory creates a record synchronously. It does not open sockets, read storage or run hooks. Use a plain factory without a registry when the caller already owns the instance. Use a derived atom for a calculation, an action for a command and an event for a fact with independent consumers."
msgstr "The factory creates a record synchronously. It does not open sockets, read storage or run hooks. Use a plain factory without a registry when the caller already owns the instance. Use a derived atom for a calculation, an action for a command and an event for a fact with independent consumers."

