#: docs/guide/model-composition.md
msgid "Type preservation"
msgstr "Type preservation"

#. Markdown. Preserve links, inline code and table/list syntax.
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: docs/guide/model-composition.md
msgid "Built-in modifiers preserve the model record, writable arguments, action results and initial input. pipe checks adjacent steps, including long chains of model-preserving modifiers. Give reusable custom modifiers an explicit ModelSource<Model, Initial> parameter so inference does not widen their input to object or any."
msgstr "Built-in modifiers preserve the model record, writable arguments, action results and initial input. pipe checks adjacent steps, including long chains of model-preserving modifiers. Give reusable custom modifiers an explicit ModelSource<Model, Initial> parameter so inference does not widen their input to object or any."

#. Markdown. Preserve links, inline code and table/list syntax.
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: docs/guide/model-composition.md
