#: docs/guide/rendering.md
msgid "Initial Suspense delays commit: **input cannot initialize the state blocking the first render**. Initialize before rendering or use native async atoms or Query. Later Suspense hiding preserves model ownership; real unmount releases it."
msgstr "Initial Suspense delays commit: **input cannot initialize the state blocking the first render**. Initialize before rendering or use native async atoms or Query. Later Suspense hiding preserves model ownership; real unmount releases it."

#. Markdown. Preserve links, inline code and table/list syntax.
