msgid "Repeated saves are ignored while one request is pending. The draft is captured before await, so later edits do not change the request. The response updates `$profile`; it does not overwrite the current draft and lose newer edits. Failures enter `$error`, emit no success fact, and clear `$saving` in finally."
msgstr "Repeated saves are ignored while one request is pending. The draft is captured before await, so later edits do not change the request. The response updates `$profile`; it does not overwrite the current draft and lose newer edits. Failures enter `$error`, emit no success fact, and clear `$saving` in finally."

